    "body": "[Changing](https://github.com/jieter/django-tables2/pull/931/changes#r3054256670) the signature from ` def render(self, record, table, value, bound_column, **kwargs):` to `def render(self, table, **kwargs):` breaks [downstream usages](https://github.com/acdh-oeaw/apis-core-rdf/issues/2344) that rely on now removed positional arguments. \n\nWe get this error:  `TemplateColumn.render() got multiple values for argument 'table'`\n\nRelated to #1031\n",
