    "body": "Hi all, according to semver https://semver.org/ :\n\n> MINOR version when you add functionality in a backward compatible manner\n\nWhich is not the case for 2.9 (also according to changelog).\n\nCan you please roll back the release and create a 3.0 , as this release might break many well defined requirements files containing \n\n`\ndjango-tables2~=2.7\n`\n\nor similar",
